  "title": "Evotec Nominates Dieter Weinand as Supervisory Board Chairman",
  "summary": "Evotec SE today announced that the Supervisory Board of Evotec SE has proposed the election of Dieter Weinand, M.S. as Chairman of the Supervisory Board at the June 11, 2026, Annual General Meeting. The nomination reflects Evotec’s continued commitment to strengthening commercial execution, strategic partnerships and long-term value creation.",
